        {
          "text": "Mpwemu w’Uhoraho amuzako, ahinduka umucamanza w’Abisirayeli. Bukeye aja gutera, maz’ Uhoraho amugomorera Kushani‐rishatayimu uwo mwami w’i Aramu‐naharayimu, aramunesha. ",
